        "Kaanukalichchenu naadu",
        "Aaraadhinchi aanandhinchi ॥2॥",
        "Yesuni chaatenu choodu ||Oho oho oho oho||"
      ]
    },
    {
      "stanza_number": 2,
      "telugu": [
